# The system's voice and the save's breath, to listen to: the boot's five notes; the pages, silent, and a blip on a piece; SAVE growing, with its three notes; SAVE
# and an autosave resting, the autosave without notes. Not one of the tests.
#   PYTHON=.venv/bin/python3 sh build.sh --host && mkdir -p app/build/listen && app/build/host/aq1_host tests/listen/system.amb app/build/listen
# (in Auto, saved, as it boots: this is the arranger's, from the top. Hands is the power-on's: hands.amb, preset_*.amb)
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
tap SAVE
wait 800
reboot
master 2430
wav system.wav
wait 6000
# the pages, slowly; a piece and back
tap ENV
wait 1500
tap ARP
wait 1500
tap LFO
wait 1500
tap HOME
wait 1500
turn PRESET 1
wait 3000
turn PRESET -1
wait 20000
# SAVE, growing (the music is well in by now)
tap SAVE
wait 6000
tap SAVE
wait 6000
# resting: SAVE, with its notes; then a knob and hands off: the autosave, 4 s later, with none
tap PLAY
wait 6000
tap SAVE
wait 6000
tap ENV
spin K2 1
wait 8000
wavstop
